# Dev-only files must never be served from the event site.
# schema.sql in particular contains the admin PIN, and anything reachable at
# https://popcat-event.vercel.app/<name> is world-readable.
*.sql
score-backup.json
sum.md
README.md
*.mjs
shots
# Full-resolution QA screenshots of the lobby and race board. They show real
# employee names and departments, so they are PII even though they are "just
# screenshots" -- and anything not listed here is world-readable.
lookshots
# Vercel's own project metadata (project + org id). Not a credential, but it
# has no business being fetchable from the event site.
.vercel
.claude
# Perf-harness calibration page: a blank control used to prove the measuring
# rig is honest before trusting a frame-time number. Not part of the event.
blank-control.html
